  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Il faut + infinitive",
   "texto": [
    "**Il faut** (it has to) is followed by infinitive. It does not change according to the person: **Il faut partir** (you must leave).",
    "To say that something should not be done: **Il ne faut pas** + infinitive: **Il ne faut pas fumer ici** (do not smoke here)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Devoir + infinitive",
   "texto": [
    "**Devoir** (duty, have to) changes according to the person: **je dois** (must), **tu dois** (must), **il doit** (must), **nous devons** (must).",
    "Then it goes infinitive: **Nous devons payer** (we have to pay)."
   ]
